Package: pcaTreeR
Type: Package
Title: PCA + MST Clonal Geometry Analysis using Rust
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Stefan", "Lang", 
           email = "stefan.lang@med.lu.se", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides a high-performance interface to the Rust crate 'pca_tree',
    offering PCA-based sequence embeddings and minimum-spanning-tree 
    (MST) geometry analysis for immunoglobulin/BCR clonal data. 
    The underlying Rust engine is extremely fast and scales to large 
    repertoires, enabling exploratory lineage visualization, clustering, 
    and graph-based structural analysis. 
    This package exposes Rust computations to R through the 'extendr' 
    framework, enabling seamless integration with R workflows, plotting 
    libraries, and downstream immunological data structures.
